 ],
 "provenance_note": "Registry-native cohort: AACT search returned 273 PCSK9-inhibitor drug records; 102 trials posted an LDL-C percent-change result; 52 had a usable active-vs-control mean difference (LS-mean + posted dispersion -> per-arm SE; fail-closed on missing SE or implausible md). AACT-results-posted cohort, NOT a dual-screened systematic review; md = active - control LDL-C % change with se = sqrt(se_active^2 + se_control^2). Synthesis hierarchy: Bayesian LDL league (pcsk9_league_bayes.json), bococizumab lead. LDL-C is a validated CV surrogate, but this analysis ranks the LDL-lowering surrogate ONLY - it is NOT a cardiovascular-event claim."
}